HTU-3945,khairy,51954,"<b>Details:</b><br> <EOL>* Length: 17""<br> <EOL>* Width: 22""<br> <EOL>* Height: 20""<br> <EOL>* Position: Hanging<br><br> <EOL> <EOL><b>Animal Facts:</b><br> <EOL>Ranges from Sierra Leone and Guinea on the Atlantic Ocean to Lakes Tanganyika and Victoria. Diurnal (active by day) & omnivorous, eating about 200 kinds of leaves & fruit; ants, honey, and birds' eggs; & birds. The gestation period is more than 7 mos long. The male chimp is 1-1.7 m tall when upright, the female is somewhat smaller. <EOL><br><br> <EOL><b>Age Group:</b><br> <EOL>The Recommended age for Hansa animals is 3 and up to comply with ASTM93 safety standards. <EOL><br><br> <EOL>"
