HTU-5046,fahad,51948,"<b>Details:</b><br> <EOL>* Length: 46""<br> <EOL>* Width: 12""<br> <EOL>* Height: 34""<br> <EOL>* Position: Standing<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>Our Stuffed Husky is strikingly beautiful, and sure to fool everyone into believing that you've added a new living friend to your home. The Life Size Stuffed Husky sports a realistic coat and magnificent features that are known to fool other dogs and animals too! <EOL><br><br> <EOL><b>Animal Facts:</b><br> <EOL>Breed of working dog from Siberia. Used as a sled dog, watchdog and pet. imported into Alaska, where it has been used as a sled dog. It is a medium-sized dog. Male is from 53- 60cm high at the shoulder; female is 51-56 cm . Has a double coat; the undercoat consists of soft, thick fur, & the outer coat is of soft, smooth hair, gives it a well "" groomed appearance. <EOL><br><br> <EOL><b>Age Group:</b><br> <EOL>The Recommended age for Hansa animals is 3 and up to comply with ASTM93 safety standards. <EOL><br><br> <EOL>"
